{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-029",
    "title": "失去的童年"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_161",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "镜中显示出另一幅画面：妇人抱着孩子走进城心，将孩子的名字交给第一盏灯；灯火熄灭后，她便忘记自己曾经有过孩子。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "暗道出口通向一座荒废的山寺。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5035,
          "end": 5035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临、顾长离和叶观澜从雪坡下钻出时，天色已近黄昏。山寺只剩半边屋顶，残墙上覆着厚雪。慧闻没有跟来，玄霄宗追兵也暂时被堵在暗道里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5037,
          "end": 5037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里曾是无相寺的分院。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5039,
          "end": 5039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5041,
          "end": 5041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在只剩一张桌子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5043,
          "end": 5043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "桌子确实还在，桌面嵌着一块黑色石板。石板中央有一道圆形凹槽，凹槽边缘刻着三方印记。顾长离把顾氏旧印按上去，石板立刻亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5045,
          "end": 5045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令。”慧闻的声音从屋外传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5047,
          "end": 5047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他踏雪进寺，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面结着霜，却能照出石板上的字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5049,
          "end": 5049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉异动期间，玄霄宗、归墟盟、无相寺暂止争夺；持印者不得开启天门；任何一方不得独自改写记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5051,
          "end": 5051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方代表随后依次落签：玄霄宗以白玉令画押，归墟盟以刀锋割掌，无相寺以经文盖印。没有一方愿意承担回川城的代价，却都承认这是共同决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5053,
          "end": 5053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看完笑了：“第三条是写给谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5055,
          "end": 5055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“写给所有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5057,
          "end": 5057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗的灰袍修士从残墙外走来。他身后只剩两名弟子，衣袍结满霜花。灰袍修士把白玉令牌放进石板凹槽，石板上的玄霄宗印记随即变得清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5059,
          "end": 5059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令必须签。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5061,
          "end": 5061
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们刚才还要抓人。”顾长离道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5063,
          "end": 5063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令之前，各守其责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5065,
          "end": 5065
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5067,
          "end": 5067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“共同阻止天门开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5069,
          "end": 5069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向石板底部：“代价写在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5071,
          "end": 5071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5073,
          "end": 5073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动铜镜。镜中浮出一座灵脉城的影像。城中仍有灯火，屋顶有人走动，孩童在街边堆雪。城心却有一道青色裂缝，正慢慢向城墙延伸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5075,
          "end": 5075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令会把异动锁在这座城。”慧闻说，“城里的人会成为锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5077,
          "end": 5077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们会怎样？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5079,
          "end": 5079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉平息，他们失去部分记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5081,
          "end": 5081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果灵脉不平息？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5083,
          "end": 5083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城会先塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5085,
          "end": 5085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离盯着镜中孩童：“你们要拿活人封门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5087,
          "end": 5087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士说：“这是最小的代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5089,
          "end": 5089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定最小？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5091,
          "end": 5091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天下需要继续运转。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5093,
          "end": 5093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把手按在刀柄上：“归墟盟不会签。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5095,
          "end": 5095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看他：“不签，天门今夜就会开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5097,
          "end": 5097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“开门未必比封门更糟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5099,
          "end": 5099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你愿意让城里的人先死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5101,
          "end": 5101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的嘴唇抿成一线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5103,
          "end": 5103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向慧闻：“无相寺的意见？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5105,
          "end": 5105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们只记录代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5107,
          "end": 5107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不阻止？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5109,
          "end": 5109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“阻止需要力量，记录只需要活下来的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5111,
          "end": 5111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "寺外忽然传来第三盏灯的声音。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5113,
          "end": 5113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩碰撞，一声、两声、三声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5115,
          "end": 5115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雪地尽头，青光穿过山谷，照出那座仍有人居住的灵脉城。城门上写着“回川”两个字，城墙内悬着数百盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5117,
          "end": 5117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它选中了回川城。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5119,
          "end": 5119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是它选中。”慧闻答，“是封天令需要一座城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5121,
          "end": 5121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士从袖中取出一卷黄纸：“回川城已经被列为封锁区。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5123,
          "end": 5123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么时候？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5125,
          "end": 5125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5127,
          "end": 5127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁签下空白，谁承担城中所有被删去的记忆。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5153,
          "end": 5153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向黄纸。空白处逐渐浮出一个名字：陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5155,
          "end": 5155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它在逼你。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5157,
          "end": 5157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它不是逼我，是在替他们找承担者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5159,
          "end": 5159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就撕掉。”叶观澜道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5161,
          "end": 5161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人回头，看见一名披灰斗篷的人走进城门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5167,
          "end": 5167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那是陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5169,
          "end": 5169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临松开黄纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5171,
          "end": 5171
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "针尾缺口朝向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5339,
          "end": 5339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有答案？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5341,
          "end": 5341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有你下一次会失去的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5343,
          "end": 5343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城内忽然传来哭喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5345,
          "end": 5345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个年轻妇人抱着孩子冲出巷口：“谁把我女儿带走了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5347,
          "end": 5347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子就在她怀里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5349,
          "end": 5349
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人低头看了孩子一眼，惊恐地把她推开。孩子摔在地上，哭着喊娘。妇人却后退：“她不是我的孩子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5351,
          "end": 5351
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临上前扶起孩子。孩子抓住他的袖口：“叔叔，你认识我娘吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5353,
          "end": 5353
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他张口想回答，却突然忘记了“母亲”这个词的含义。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5355,
          "end": 5355
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "胸口残印骤然发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5357,
          "end": 5357
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一把将孩子抱走：“别看她的眼睛。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5359,
          "end": 5359
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相铜镜。镜中显示出另一幅画面：妇人抱着孩子走进城心，将孩子的名字交给第一盏灯；灯火熄灭后，她便忘记自己曾经有过孩子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5361,
          "end": 5361
        }
      }
    ],
